     rors and the pool must not be in the process of resilvering.  At the time
     of the split, _n_e_w_p_o_o_l will be a replica of _p_o_o_l.  By default, the last
     device in each mirror is split from _p_o_o_l to create _n_e_w_p_o_o_l.

